  "html": "<div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c4a97bd7-1ec4-4c94-8a01-6dc59a8cd2a3\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-c4a97bd7-1ec4-4c94-8a01-6dc59a8cd2a3\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfMjgy/MDAxNzQxNzQ4OTQyMjM1.tua6_A59Z0cCbVyaztYvyLW-37ng9NQDSknQMa0Jz9Ug.ZCoyI_0YtnZE6FAfP5l344tiAV4K40rnj3tEg8_csXAg.JPEG/SE-c4a97bd7-1ec4-4c94-8a01-6dc59a8cd2a3.jpg\", \"originalWidth\" : \"2250\", \"originalHeight\" : \"2250\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfMjgy/MDAxNzQxNzQ4OTQyMjM1.tua6_A59Z0cCbVyaztYvyLW-37ng9NQDSknQMa0Jz9Ug.ZCoyI_0YtnZE6FAfP5l344tiAV4K40rnj3tEg8_csXAg.JPEG/SE-c4a97bd7-1ec4-4c94-8a01-6dc59a8cd2a3.jpg?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfMjgy/MDAxNzQxNzQ4OTQyMjM1.tua6_A59Z0cCbVyaztYvyLW-37ng9NQDSknQMa0Jz9Ug.ZCoyI_0YtnZE6FAfP5l344tiAV4K40rnj3tEg8_csXAg.JPEG/SE-c4a97bd7-1ec4-4c94-8a01-6dc59a8cd2a3.jpg?type=w966\" data-width=\"886\" data-height=\"886\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-18c3b53c-6457-427f-8abb-2c99b78e1e85\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e90a1c4f-2a70-4dc8-b624-0497ee3c5af8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-71e00aac-9604-4685-ac4c-344617f09387\">가슴 성형을 고려할 때 가장 중요한 요소 중 하나는 신뢰할 수 있는 보형물 브랜드를 선택하는 것입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-72ba77fd-1c67-471d-a185-c69afb28514b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6713c339-17ca-4cfb-b256-eafb65d536c1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b655c35f-9aee-4a95-8863-e4c811097c80\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-1cb5bc4a-aecf-442b-abb3-4972f3a1c818\"><b>멘토(Mentor)</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0f00a98c-f464-4ce0-8076-332c540974ff\">는 1969년 설립되어 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-23c2669e-ce4c-418d-af55-818855566fb4\"><b>50년 이상의 역사를 가진 글로벌 브랜드</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ad0f4705-0ce6-4823-9249-1bf003ec7e93\">로, 오랜 기간 가슴 성형과 함께 발전해온 대표적인 보형물 제조사입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-859b7cb9-7274-482a-849f-3a8c6013742c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-bb97e8c4-3dd9-4284-b790-6474e68207f7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8b0a30b9-4455-4fa7-962c-112f326d55d8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-62c400ee-2071-4db3-a44f-77030c3b1352\">멘토 보형물은 외피(Shell)와 충전젤(Gel) 모두 미국 FDA 승인을 받은 제품으로,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-047c6b0e-8417-4d97-b8fc-612dc73f4569\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c3446bb0-6a8c-4441-a19b-4e84745cb3a8\">✔ </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c2996c13-c46e-45ca-90a4-a9745f90e03d\">광범위한 임상시험을 거쳐 안전성이 검증</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-b61c7dc5-7cd7-4f6c-a5a9-684967ce4da5\">되었으며</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c137d641-158f-4365-b9ca-e2be1975af04\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c8f15802-71a9-4aa1-92da-9134677fb309\">✔ </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-412dba71-ab68-4b33-875f-53724b8e7090\">충전율에 따라 다양한 라인업을 제공</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3e532475-d9ad-448e-bb3d-72a30ad670db\">하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f057634e-8bdf-4c71-b812-e3aadafa7521\">.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1ea32b2b-d213-4192-a498-1d4f40777aba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ea1716e2-e4df-4034-9dae-ef25da1cd5c8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_postit\" id=\"SE-15b9ef69-e4da-47e3-97aa-24b6fc54640b\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_postit\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-59ef9a71-9b7a-4321-9eec-624690c0bd81\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7e96e28f-f024-4308-a7e6-524d607dbffe\"><b>표면 타입별 분류</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-709f99be-12b8-4964-9d5f-e02e74605a19\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-906b1bd9-4887-40fb-8e09-b91188a0c75e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5f5fbcf-6be6-4c90-b64f-ff9b6ff245f8\"><span style=\"color:#666666;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-fac66110-8943-49c4-93d7-6c80262d1376\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1b4d3137-601d-47d2-874e-da15d3ca45a7\"> 멘토 스무스 (Mentor Smooth)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cb17adfb-c5d9-4293-9267-7880f86be961\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-98deed7a-7117-41e3-891f-6ce67198a55c\"> 일반적인 스무스 타입 보형물</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1565e126-8deb-4f9b-8967-bd244da0c817\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-02efab62-055f-4375-9ead-07b9841f691d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7ef8c8d-404f-446a-9533-d8c60c77ed9c\"><span style=\"color:#666666;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b7b28c91-004d-4c0f-bb9a-d66efe403942\">👉 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b7859906-dac0-4310-9497-78cd362dc583\">멘토 엑스트라스무스 (Mentor Extra Smooth)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b11124f9-d17e-4d9a-8906-12b1e08eb367\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e17e9173-cad1-4977-8781-bb6cea5eafad\"> 더욱 매끄러운 표면을 가진 보형물</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ab24015c-7ee3-4637-8d99-1223457e9dc2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-849c9ba7-4000-4de5-842b-791e65285c3a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13f20dc8-26da-4781-aa94-9fbc24e5f129\"><span style=\"color:#666666;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1d13c3c8-b119-4a3d-a6a7-3a75260d8e8a\">👉 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-611fe81b-2f3c-4ac0-a905-7c5acc5c8ca1\">멘토 부스트 (Mentor Boost)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1490eb15-206a-490d-a58c-0bfe5a2e44aa\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f151aa39-1738-4110-8d8a-24450da7320f\">보다 높은 볼륨감을 제공하는 보형물</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b218832-c78d-4f80-9805-a19e45af635e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-20e7933a-06b1-41e3-a035-789a85fc97f7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2c1b0aae-585f-4440-b657-301603d64b2f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9d7a00d7-a06d-413d-874b-17ec8c8ffe50\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0e021588-dc7b-48d0-975c-47cc00f890e2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0caf5cb1-aad5-40e6-b1a2-e8d4598f18e6\">이처럼 멘토 보형물은 표면 타입과 모양에 따라 다양한 옵션이 존재하며, 개개인의 체형과 원하는 스타일에 따라 선택할 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4d81ca2c-8ef3-41d1-90d3-00840edfe52f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8f9ad251-4443-4abc-a151-635b1278230c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4384fb7a-f2e1-4792-81bd-8f953eb05acc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-1bb4ab73-38b1-4897-bb62-df32532c6a46\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f4d2a05a-e475-42be-9f5c-f53f78b34f18\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d8f84076-b986-4e4a-8f34-52c484cc2e86\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-cd73d8ba-9229-44df-8349-4b46e840347e\"><b>1. 모양 (Shape) </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-85c243e2-cb80-42db-b2fe-10da60dda16e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-8743f37f-0431-4d0c-b7ef-5a6b318ef9dd\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-e322381a-209b-4ef0-8d1e-2f47f79ad4ec\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-23b1e64d-df3d-4be2-988c-ac971e365f7d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-71ca6d35-0bd9-4c36-b543-c84a9b5e0dbe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-5073595c-1812-4e75-8b95-666394260de9\">멘토 보형물은 MemoryGel이라는 독자적인 충전젤을 사용합니다.이 젤은</span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4345d922-e815-4242-80f9-f4937990dc83\"> 1:1 비율의 교차결합(Crosslink) 구조로 되어 있어 응집력이 강하며 흐르지 않는 특징</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3cc8d1c3-94cc-4d8e-8ea2-0b7dc901b526\">을 가집니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a4d978d-bd8b-473e-a768-8a639b76838a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3826468b-b77d-4dbe-a87b-505df74a1319\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21a6738f-2b1c-4c96-b52c-a1873c47021a\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-26a1ff9c-575a-4559-b9e8-29260de2ecb8\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4e589c8f-f280-499b-a799-9a3e51a04112\"> 이로 인해, 서 있을 때 보형물의 MPP(최대 돌출 지점)이 다른 보형물보다 상방에 위치하게 됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cf9b1b14-4ad3-4c5b-a32b-37302d502094\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c8b98440-220e-4e7e-ba95-3722ec612ea2\">✔ </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0d479a63-b7b3-40db-bf84-e1eda757bf3d\">유두에서 밑선까지의 거리가 충분한 경우, 이러한 형태가 더욱 자연스럽고 아름다운 곡선을 형성하는 데 유리합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2f7cd31c-b390-45db-b54b-4cc75e341ab9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-427d0511-6d46-4b52-90de-83c68edc6991\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57fedc5f-e882-4ebe-ba4c-4a82722204f2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-648c340f-734a-4279-ab58-82592a57dcbd\">즉, 가슴의 볼륨이 좀 더 상방에 집중되길 원하는 경우 멘토 보형물이 좋은 선택이 될 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-bc371ec1-25b9-40e5-a3a4-72734ce236c4\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-bc371ec1-25b9-40e5-a3a4-72734ce236c4\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfODAg/MDAxNzQxNzQ4NTE2MDIz.pyxXwbyrBzmUNuXdJJtcj50IaFDZPOFAZXH4HhR6CTEg.ZvmA-3w2N_E_1M0WB82-M_Go3ECb1mg-tZ6BpueczuYg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1186\", \"originalHeight\" : \"558\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfODAg/MDAxNzQxNzQ4NTE2MDIz.pyxXwbyrBzmUNuXdJJtcj50IaFDZPOFAZXH4HhR6CTEg.ZvmA-3w2N_E_1M0WB82-M_Go3ECb1mg-tZ6BpueczuYg.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTJfODAg/MDAxNzQxNzQ4NTE2MDIz.pyxXwbyrBzmUNuXdJJtcj50IaFDZPOFAZXH4HhR6CTEg.ZvmA-3w2N_E_1M0WB82-M_Go3ECb1mg-tZ6BpueczuYg.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-width=\"886\" data-height=\"416\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ac55463d-3ff7-42a1-b09b-b8e5369c49b2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a4020ff9-cf13-4f87-8fdf-76fa215c2eaa\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-583b1756-ce45-4568-9d02-8a6cfc42942c\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-b8c67fad-fd41-4c6e-9c15-4e495a5aa65d\"><b>2. 촉감 (Texture) </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ee4e5200-2075-4abb-890c-328d4f4f8f7d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-5cf3663f-fe07-472c-9c29-047c785331df\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-2189366c-eb06-4530-b258-53af302ef044\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-981c1e89-0c3f-4381-a5d2-d6d7f64da367\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-649e38a0-9610-4679-b205-226b240e50c8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a61ab1c5-826c-467c-8e80-a03a45405a25\">멘토 보형물의 충전젤은 </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-53244fd9-8372-480d-91a4-c030e1e7238c\">부드럽고 유연한 질감</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1c7bbc16-1747-42ce-9ed1-ff2ef512df02\">을 가지고 있어, 환자분들이 직접 만져보고 비교했을 때 가장 선호도가 높은 보형물 중 하나로 꼽힙니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c583a52-7342-40b0-92c9-e4379b295365\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2a7b5471-37e0-4b79-a1b7-b8db151048bb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f30c4f8b-2d82-4df4-a484-a237b07431b7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-b900973a-b6ba-48b7-9ac4-b8c3bab65889\">많은 분들이 촉감을 설명할 때 슬라임처럼 말랑말랑한 느낌 혹은 도토리묵과 같은 탄력 있는 부드러움이라고 표현하기도 합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a0da8fb5-25c2-48ab-84d6-8a0d5b29091f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-64a23c2d-9af0-4346-ba85-069ace32c1b8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78d04f65-0fd6-4720-b25e-0f321ac7abae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3f9496fd-7699-4d53-bf34-9118dc1f3d62\">자연스럽고 부드러운 촉감을 원하는 분들에게 특히 추천할 수 있는 보형물입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d42b705d-cf4d-4e69-b972-dbcbdf6d35a5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3173e66e-9d80-4edb-b36c-996fa95120cc\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8aa58946-1a8b-4075-b329-34b2d4261a49\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-a12e56f3-e6d7-4b61-bc87-7e744a463a81\"><b>3. 안정성 (Safety) </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f2c54dd4-c315-4ee0-87c0-1b424f4d3f3d\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-b94e730c-16e5-46d6-92b8-dfb621400cac\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5532fc9-e4a4-4c69-a668-18259ce5bb37\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1d425d09-d3c9-43c8-b40b-71e4bdfa9144\">멘토 보형물은 1982년 출시 이후, </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-27dcc0a6-bb81-4242-9ece-002354298433\">40년 이상의 장기적인 임상 데이터를 보유</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-50295964-ae80-463c-b446-584d1aff47ce\">하고 있어 </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3c1bbc27-8a9f-49bb-b2bc-4978f2dfc3b6\">안정성이 검증된 제품</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e324beef-76da-4ab8-b169-26249808108a\">입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5898a654-6b60-409a-9f3e-638de31767b5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-977031d3-ee8c-4927-8651-d3aa915adcbb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e16be1e-bf27-41cd-8043-ed62ddf596f6\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-791be988-3c85-40b6-b484-c0c212a964d3\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a25aa3b4-b7af-4492-bc7f-89b3b077bb8d\"> MemoryGel과 외피(Shell) 모두 FDA 승인 획득</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3bf7dd1d-8810-4c1d-b0af-dbdd43eef460\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e794814b-5374-4c65-99d7-7ea95fb1f508\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-653977fc-3cd4-43f4-91a4-a047e9b2f187\"> 0.27μm의 Smooth 타입 표면 구조로, 박테리아 발생률이 낮아 감염 위험 최소화</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-327f79e2-4950-487a-a46c-2ec1b774f6f1\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-897927b5-acbd-4891-b090-14bf30956089\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-df1c30d7-0af5-41b1-9232-80627c21fbd7\"> 전 세계적으로 널리 사용되는 보형물 브랜드로 오랜 기간 신뢰받고 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5e96da68-b61b-4376-aba3-ad753ff51002\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3ec1fd67-7302-437a-bbbd-7fca490efef6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-06f6fc10-729c-43d6-bfc0-76dafc1185f7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7c199152-3734-434f-9449-a088b0357f04\">특히, 표면이 매우 매끄러운 스무스 타입 보형물로 분류되며, 거친 텍스처로 인한 염증 반응이 적다는 점도 장점 중 하나입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-9e77775c-348a-4690-a0ac-2955311754f2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-be1c8a8c-31bb-4fe3-846a-84e0c2e74699\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c8baea09-d221-40f7-bf7e-bc0f97406df6\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-81210f58-7bc3-430d-ad62-94a5541e482c\"><b>4. 가격 (Price)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-451b213a-c519-4036-9671-114b7ea31051\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-69ad060f-27d5-4b89-93bb-94dc3f848490\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-50bcda53-649e-40d2-9605-6ba79074ee5e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a151cfaa-15b0-4c3a-8b94-4a3a52025c30\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c97cc1f7-7532-4eb9-8e39-855b15cc2a4c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-cb9857dc-afbf-467a-85ca-5571ffe496c1\">멘토 보형물은 충전율과 모델에 따라 가격이 차이가 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c218bb8e-699d-45b3-a50c-587e9e96cbcd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-863a3928-8df6-45dd-9a44-d6e13a007832\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d9ab85c0-fb1d-4039-9255-84b5ce3f12a0\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-655d416b-7224-4a1a-b10f-17d05368bf20\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d1c1db81-0d3b-4af0-be3c-dd3fb103f7c2\"> 멘토 스무스, 엑스트라스무스, 부스트 라인업에 따라 가격 차이가 존재</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8029f4af-aa08-417b-ba2a-396e4a9f638d\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-72eb2fec-37b9-4730-8afb-42b60b34825f\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-33302741-fa66-494f-8d0f-4db76f83579a\"> 현재 사용되는 프리미엄 보형물 중 중간 가격대</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d56b8681-410f-454a-b7d6-00f71e21429e\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3998edd4-f0f5-4eaa-b51a-d230ea97345e\">✔</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-96b54335-2d9b-49f9-bc8f-81eaed27c050\"> 정확한 비용은 개인별 맞춤 상담 후 확인 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6d7603d3-bac8-48f5-a091-d50037415008\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ddac98be-0380-4dea-9529-dec33f0861b6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7403c953-2309-418c-9b1f-baaae12829c1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e9d6b75d-810d-44ff-94ea-c422f9589ace\">멘토는 오랜 임상 데이터와 신뢰성 높은 브랜드 가치에 비해 가격이 합리적인 편이라, 비용 대비 높은 만족도를 원하는 분들에게 적합한 선택이 될 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53f7e6af-0502-4372-a864-bd8dd9fed24c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-08873913-1a95-4280-8872-5b142dddd07c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4301fbbb-e8ee-456f-982b-585dbdfd8466\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c7e678e7-9558-4b5e-98ec-0d156b56eec8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d171337c-fc64-43b7-81c0-75d336823ab6\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-6fab0156-f41a-4e16-b907-9e1e249ad1c6\"><b>Tip. 개인의 신체 구조와 선호도에 따라 비용이 달라질 수 있으므로, 정확한 상담을 통해 안내해드리고 있습니다. 예약 후 상담을 통해 자세한 비용을 확인해 주세요.</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-41c6dcd8-13f3-4a7b-8523-ccf7c1e28975\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-0a60612c-d9ca-4260-a88d-e879733da0cd\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-94101631-159a-402c-bd38-b1eeac0491a0\"><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-7dc550b9-9858-4179-a3fb-34fed5e1b275\"><b>5. 워런티 (Warrenty)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4fcfc2c-865c-47d4-9000-2dceeb93a845\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-8e595678-ef9b-476c-b19e-c85bdf4cd52c\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-default\" id=\"SE-fe268c75-d6b3-4930-8cde-8497546453a2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-67e8ed89-3eaf-4883-aa5e-b633e31d2880\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8ac2e4e8-0609-42e9-bbaf-9b276aeb5f51\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-9b8d484f-fd96-4533-86a9-b9d56177771d\">멘토는 </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-f5e5f546-c58e-4c7d-ba9a-0ad7ee9cd789\"><b>평생 보증 정책을 제공</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a5dc2d89-c30d-4d65-af3a-d774a264ba60\">하며, 보형물에 이상이 발생할 경우 </span><span style=\"color:#004e82;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ae423096-32f0-45a3-a281-37ea6f10db59\">무상으로 새 보형물을 지급하는 시스템을 운영</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ea41247b-2201-4e5e-8a72-a362e6958c4f\">하고 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f186d694-0d85-4c9f-ab33-434ec6c99fb0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-feaf9c86-a908-4ef4-bdda-3784e6121a0f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf46e321-836d-4314-bb87-285586540ed8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d36bac8c-46cd-43dc-a410-731f385df242\">✔ 보형물 파열 및 손상 시, 평생 무상 보형물 제공</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3df39c42-c49a-40a6-9407-df6ada5338a6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-640adbfb-8eb0-47b7-ad22-1d93e4d21077\">✔ 장기적인 안정성과 신뢰성을 보장하는 브랜드</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5343c59e-62c8-4484-8d56-606808523f93\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a153286f-7756-47f7-bb00-45640d60494c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f118bd8d-2a66-40e6-8d22-d54a6bc19d4f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d6f8d11e-c9ca-4373-94c3-3be6d4928927\">멘토 보형물은 안정성과 오랜 역사, 뛰어난 촉감으로 많은 분들에게 사랑받고 있는 제품입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d5f33b9b-9156-450c-8a3a-cae47955b015\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-866acc6e-a8b1-40d8-a2a0-e8ef0ec7ccf